<title>SINGAPORE: Natsteel explores closer cooperation with Acominas.</title>
<headline>Natsteel explores closer cooperation with Acominas.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steel company Natsteel Ltd said on Friday it had a long-standing trading relationship with Brazilian company Acominas &quot;as a major customer of their billets&quot;.</p>
<p>The company said in a brief statement:</p>
<p>&quot;We are exploring the possibility of closer cooperation with them and will make more specific announcements when appropriate.&quot;</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
